                                "sense_id": "1a4c3dc5-1e7c-3f5f-a647-29ac86c5a82c",
                                "text": "Again, any subject concerning the situation or welfare of mankind has a direct or indirect bearing on PWDs either both as members of society and as PWDs."
                            },
