                                "sense_id": "1a4c3dc5-1e7c-3f5f-a647-29ac86c5a82c",
                                "text": "Polyrhythmic refers to the rhythm of identity markers changing in importance to the person and to society. A person may identify more as a woman and second as a PWD. Disabilities can be visible and invisible."
